Z||000000||zeusrekning||06-26-2000||08:30 PM||||It is a medium metallic red 87 coupe. It has 220,000 miles on it i have replaced clutch, alternator, starter, timing gears, new tires, slave cylinder , master cylinder,and, o2 sensor.I have posted that i'm having suspension problems. It is running good now other than i need,Toe link rod, front tie rod i think,alighnment, new motor mounts and tranny mounts, dog bone. <P>My main ????? is how long do you rekon my motor will last. I would not be suprised if it was replaced before i got it. If not it was really taken care of. Is there any way to check and see if the engine has been replaced??||||reg||5
